    {
      "task_id": "scala_http_intervals_hidden",
      "title": "Scheduling profit API",
      "problem_statement": "Implement POST /schedule. Its UTF-8 body is n followed by n triples start end profit, separated by whitespace. Select mutually nonoverlapping half-open intervals [start,end) and return 200 with the maximum total profit as decimal text. Adjacent intervals are allowed; selecting none is allowed. 0 <= n <= 200000; 0 <= start < end <= 1000000000; 0 <= profit <= 1000000000. Invalid format or bounds returns 400 with body invalid. Other methods at /schedule return 405 with body method; other paths return 404 with body missing. Use 64-bit profit; choose an efficient algorithm yourself.",
      "category": "other",
      "difficulty": "hard",
      "split": "hidden",
      "language": "scala",
      "execution_mode": "http",
      "visible_tests": [
        {
          "requests": [
            {
              "method": "POST",
              "path": "/schedule",
              "body": "4 0 3 5 1 2 6 2 4 7 3 5 4",
              "expected_status": 200,
